      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This prayer by Rabbi Henry S. Jacobs was offered at the 25th anniversary of the Independent Order of B’ne B’rith’s Isaiah Lodge No49 of New York on 16 December 1888 and published in <tei:hi rend="italic">The Menorah</tei:hi>, vol. 6, no. 1 (January 1889), p. 61. The Isaiah Lodge No49 of New York was founded on 20 December 1863.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
